<title>UK: UK's Bellway names acting chief executive.</title>
<headline>UK's Bellway names acting chief executive.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>British housebuilder Bellway Plc said on Monday that Howard Dawe had been appointed acting executive chairman of the company after its non-executive chairman Kenneth Bell died on Sunday.</p>
<p>Earlier this month the company reported first half pre-tax profits of 17.9 million stg against 12.3 million in the previous year.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
</text>
